# Sync / folder failure diagnostics

Before spending time on Sync folder failures (especially opaque API strings):

1. **Read** [docs/STANDARDS-sync-diagnostics.md](docs/STANDARDS-sync-diagnostics.md).
2. Read **`Library/logs/folder-sync.jsonl`** first (on-disk trace). Console `[folder-sync]` is secondary.
3. If needed: `folder_pending_ops` in `catalog.sqlite` under the Library path.

## Non-negotiables

- New folder-sync failure/heal paths must call `logFolderSyncFailure` so events land on disk under `Library/logs/`.
- User-visible sync error strings should include the pending-ops headline when ops remain.
- “Locked on this client” = **user-edit lock** for a project-marked folder with no local project document — not a filesystem lock. Do not auto-take over foreign project markers on Sync.
- Marker clears require ownership assertion (`project_id`). Unowned empty-meta clears are dropped; do not rewrite them from cloud markers to force upload.
